'''The Queen & The Maiden''' (女帝と乙女, ''Nyotei to Otome'', '''Empress and Maiden''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Honey Trap]] and [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Bombergirl]] respectively. To unlock The Queen & The Maiden, you must clear both Queen's Coronation and Deeply Dreaming.

